<title>USA: CPI Corp Q3 Nov 9 net up after gain.</title>
<headline>CPI Corp Q3 Nov 9 net up after gain.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.36		    $0.24</p>
<p> Net			  5,000		    3,300</p>
<p> Revs			 145.4		    166.2</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.15		    $0.39</p>
<p> Net			  2,111		    5,398</p>
<p> Revs		     355,543		  376,605</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: FY97 Q3 and 9-mos nets include after-tax gain of $3.9 million ($6.18 million pre-tax), or $0.28/shr after-tax, on sale of 51 percent of Fox Studio photofinishing segment to Eastman Kodak Co.  FY96 Q3 net excludes loss of $94,000, or $0.01/shr, from discontinued operations.  FY96 9-mos net excludes loss of $644,000, or $0.05/shr, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
